{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Hoppin: Into the Woods</i>, you play as Buna, a devoted mother rabbit searching for carrots deep in the forest. You'll need logic and creativity to overcome the challenges ahead. Use dashes, strategic object placement, and precise timing to collect every carrot and solve the puzzles in each stage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Think Before You Leap</strong><br>Each level is a unique puzzle. Observe the environment, place the right objects in the right spots, and uncover the movement path that will lead you forward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chase Every Carrot</strong><br>To progress, plan routes that let you gather every carrot and unlock the exit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No Time for Naps</strong><br>Timing and precision are key to mastering the forest's trickiest challenges.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1454830?t=1760325398","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1454830?t=1760325398","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1454830/69c571a13a0c511800c0b169b4100edb4188d001/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760325398","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1454830/69c571a13a0c511800c0b169b4100edb4188d001/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760325398","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Hoppin: Into the Woods</i>, you play as Buna, a devoted mother rabbit searching for carrots deep in the forest. You'll need logic and creativity to overcome the challenges ahead. Use dashes, strategic object placement, and precise timing to collect every carrot and solve the puzzles in each stage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Think Before You Leap</strong><br>Each le